## Reading of the method
The design wants a separate coordinator, fresh sessions, equal sources, fixed criteria, and costs beyond speed. The four cases in the submission are where those sentences do not yet check the failure they name. C01 is a missing conflicting snapshot. C02 is a quoted hold followed by a contradicted action. C03 is an assisted package edited after the baseline return. C04 is authoring and repair time left outside the session log. AR-01 stays a hold. I ran no fixture.

